 ika Mann (Sandra Hüller) on a road trip across Germany in the aftermath o
 f World War II.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/fatherland\n\nE
 stimated start: 16:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
