BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sevda
DTSTART:20261107T234500Z
DTEND:20261108T014000Z
DTSTAMP:20261107T234500Z
UID:XsT0S2O6g6
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 100 mins (1h40m)\n\nSeattle Turkish Film Festival A
  real estate developer in Istanbul faces a halted deal when an old Ottoman
  cemetery and its elderly caretaker block her project. As her buried famil
 y past surfaces\, she discovers her story is entangled with the city's his
 tory.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/seattle-turkish-film-fest
 ival-2026/sevda\n\nEstimated start: 16:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Yellow Letters Gala & Party
DTSTART:20261108T020000Z
DTEND:20261108T041500Z
DTSTAMP:20261108T020000Z
UID:NKCpg9ySJF
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nSeattle Turkish Film FestivalSTF
 F: Seattle Turkish Film Festival will be hosting Gala Film Yellow Letter
 s at SIFF Cinema Uptown\, followed by a Gala Party at KEXP with special fi
 lmmaker guests visiting from Turkey\, music\, food and a cash/card bar. 
  The marriage of Derya and Aziz is under pressure after losing their jobs
  and having to move to Istanbul to live with Aziz's parents. They and thei
 r 13-year-old daughter Ezgi have to redefine their way of life.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/seattle-turkish-film-festival-2026/seattl
 e-turkish-film-festival-gala-film-party\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
