 FFDocs is part of STFFShorts Program and a celebration of short documentar
 y films. This year\, STFFDocs presents a curated selection of 4 short film
 s\, offering exceptional filmmakers international exposure and the opportu
 nity to connect with Northwest audiences. For more details\, please visit 
 our website at stff.org/stff-docs.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theat
 ers/seattle-turkish-film-festival-2026/stffshorts-documentary-selection\n
 \nEstimated start: 11:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
