SUMMARY:Salvation
DTSTART:20261109T020000Z
DTEND:20261109T041500Z
DTSTAMP:20261109T020000Z
UID:C6r9m7olTc
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 117 mins (1h57m)\n\nIn a historical moment when an 
 “us versus them” mentality is fueling polarization around the world\, 
 director Emin Alper grapples with this issue in a timeless tale with real-
 world resonance.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/salvation\n\nEstimated s
 tart: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
